{"slug":"greetings-starter-l6","artistFeel":"Marc Anthony","beat":"Energetic Normal","data":{"title":"Greetings & Conversation — Starter · Lesson 6","subject":"greetings","subjectLabel":"Greetings & Conversation","level":"starter","lesson":6,"totalLessons":20,"genre":"Salsa","lyrics":"[Intro]\n¡Ay, qué calorcito!\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nGood day… Buenos días\nCome play… Ven a jugar\nSaluda… Greet the sun\nAmable… Kind hearts\nMeet here… Aquí nos encontramos\nVamos a la playa.\n\n[Verse]\nSun's up, we're on the sand,\nListening to the ocean's band.\nGood morning… Buenos días\nFeeling the breeze today.\nAmable… Kind faces\nEverywhere we go.\nHola… Hello again\nTo friends we know.\n\n[Hook]\nHello… Hola\nGood day… Buenos días\nCome play… Ven a jugar\nSaluda… Greet the sun\nAmable… Kind hearts\nMeet here… Aquí nos encontramos\nVamos a la playa.\n\n[Verse]\nWhat's your name?… ¿Cuál es tu nombre?\nNice to meet you… Encantado\nPresenta… Introduce yourself\nLet's get to know the crew.\nEscucha… Listen closely\nTo the waves and their song.\nHabla… Speak your mind\nJoin in, come along.\n\n[Bridge]\nThe sun's so bright, it feels right,\nRespuesta… Answer the call.\nPregunta… Ask the waves\nWhat secrets they hold.\nDe nada… You're welcome\nFor this perfect day.\nLet's stay… Quedémonos\nAnd watch the sky turn gray.\n","vocab":[{"es":"buenos días/tardes","en":"good morning/afternoon"},{"es":"saluda","en":"greet"},{"es":"amable","en":"kind"},{"es":"nombre","en":"name"},{"es":"encantado","en":"nice to meet you"},{"es":"presenta","en":"introduce"},{"es":"escucha","en":"listen"},{"es":"habla","en":"speak"},{"es":"responde","en":"answer"},{"es":"pregunta","en":"ask"},{"es":"cuídate","en":"take care"},{"es":"hasta pronto","en":"see you soon"},{"es":"¿qué tal?","en":"how's it going?"},{"es":"disculpa","en":"excuse me"},{"es":"buen día","en":"good day"}]},"timings":[{"start":0.06,"end":1.7209999999999999,"loss":4.47326398577009},{"start":5,"end":6.8,"loss":6.688552300135295},{"start":6.8